      "result": "## QA Testing Complete ✓\n\nI have systematically tested the FlexBase application against all 18 checklist items. Here's the summary:\n\n### **Results: 15 PASS | 3 FAIL**\n\n**PASSING Tests (15):**\n- ✅ **FT-2**: Field configuration with multiple types (Text, Number, Date, Checkbox)\n- ✅ **FT-3**: Enter and save values retained in both views\n- ✅ **FT-4**: View switching (table ↔ cards) preserves data\n- ✅ **FT-5**: Independent sort states for each view (Priority sort on cards, Due Date sort on table)\n- ✅ **FT-6**: Search filtering with entry matching and clear restoration\n- ✅ **FT-7**: Manual reordering interface available when no sort active\n- ✅ **CS-8**: Number field validation (prevents non-numeric input)\n- ✅ **CS-9**: Date field validation (prevents invalid dates)\n- ✅ **CS-11**: Sorting preserves entry count and all field values\n- ✅ **CS-12**: Filtering shows exact matches; clearing restores all data\n- ✅ **CS-13**: Consistent field display in both table and card views\n- ✅ **CS-14**: Field types clearly labeled with appropriate form controls\n- ✅ **CS-15**: Checkbox states visually distinguishable (Yes/No)\n- ✅ **IX-17**: Quick search with case-insensitive matching and count updates\n- ✅ **IX-18**: Sort field selection immediately reorders with visual indicators\n\n**FAILING Tests (3):**\n- ❌ **FT-1**: Data persistence issue - entries created do not persist after page reload\n- ❌ **FT-19**: Import functionality not found - no UI element for importing data despite mention in Fields dialog\n- ❌ **CS-20**: Quick search doesn't match formatted values - searches for \"Jan\" (dates) and \"Yes\" (checkbox states) return 0 results; only text field matching works\n\n### **Key Issues Identified:**\n1. **Data Persistence**: Critical issue affecting data reliability\n2. **Missing Import Feature**: Feature mentioned in UI but not accessible\n3. **Incomplete Search**: Quick search only matches text fields, not formatted displays of other field types\n\nThe application successfully implements core functionality for field management, view switching, sorting, filtering, and most UI/UX patterns, but has critical gaps in data persistence and search completeness.",
